<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel &amp; fight your way, you will meet beautiful, skilled companions to rescue &amp; add to your party. Customize your new companions, gear &amp; costume them up, build their skill trees &amp; teach them new spells &amp; strategies. Your companions will also live in your Harem base, and you can see them in their daily routines -sleeping, bathing, entertaining- when you are not outside adventuring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426120/extras/5ade5bf681fec00497550cbff0b06cf7.webp?t=1754913174\" /></span></p>",
